    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[img][/img]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ScrapWings is a classic arcade airplane game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Take advantage of exploration zones between missions to recycle scrap metal and upgrade your ship. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Test your skills through lovingly handcrafted missions and earn the gold medal if you can. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Face colossal motherships in key progression missions.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[img][/img]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ScrapWings is a classic arcade airplane game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Take advantage of exploration zones between missions to recycle scrap metal and upgrade your ship. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Test your skills through lovingly handcrafted missions and earn the gold medal if you can. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Face colossal motherships in key progression missions.</p>",
